Say your answer out loud.

215
00:15:57,973 --> 00:16:02,616
A strong answer first says, in one sentence,
what pinning does protect against, in

216
00:16:02,656 --> 00:16:07,128
Git terms. Then it gives three limits
that are different in kind, each with its

217
00:16:07,168 --> 00:16:11,868
reason: one about the pinned code itself,
